                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 15 Â· Statement Reader\nBank statement PDF upload karo â†’ AI har transaction ki draft entry banata hai (ledger suggest karta hai) â†’ sheet mein. Kam confidence wali entries CHECK mark. **Accountant check karta hai, tab hi Tally mein jaata hai.**\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PekwdOMv-gL8o6y3xGgVoltEnXlN4rOA/edit. Tab **Draft entries**.\n2. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n3. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID). Replace 917070709694.\n\nLong statements: split by month. Scanned PDFs need OCR first.",
