                      "parameters":  {
                                         "promptType":  "define",
                                         "text":  "=Bank statement text for client {{ $(\u0027Upload statement\u0027).item.json.Client }}:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nFor EVERY transaction return: date (yyyy-mm-dd), narration, amount (number), type (Dr/Cr), a suggested ledger (e.g. Sales, Purchase, Rent, Salary, Bank Charges, GST Payment, Owner Drawings, Loan, Suspense), and confidence 0-1. Use Suspense with low confidence when unsure. Do not invent transactions; copy amounts exactly.",
